title: "UniVII"
abstract: "UniVI, a mixture-of-experts multimodal variational autoencoder for integrating, translating, and generating single-cell multi-omics data, extended with hyperbolic and product latent spaces, convolutional encoders and decoders, spatial tools, and plug-in architectures."
